{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26091","headline":"读李相心中乐 · 鲍溶","name":"读李相心中乐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"负海狂鲸纵巨鳞，四朝天子阻时巡。\n谁将侯玉乖南面，几使戎军殷左轮。\n久作妖星虚费日，终□天洞亦何人。\n果闻丞相心中乐，上赞陶唐一万春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26091.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26091","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}